    "created_at": "2025-03-31T20:51:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-31T20:51:37Z",
    "body": "Hmm, interesting issue. I agree it might make sense to add a UA rule to make long popover/dialog text scrollable. Is `max-height: 100svb;` the right such rule?\n\nThere's a (perhaps small?) risk of compat for this change, particularly for dialogs. Having said that, perhaps for those sites that change as a result of the new rule, it'll be an improvement?",
