    "created_at": "2025-04-01T22:28:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-01T22:28:17Z",
    "body": "I noticed that removing the `[popover] { height: fit-content }` rule from the UA styles seems to fix this, and without it I think that popovers would fill the whole viewport.\n\nmax-height:100svb seems like an easy fix, but would be worth asking CSSWG people if this is how height:fit-content is supposed to work and whether there are any other options.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
